    "description": "Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises is actively seeking a talented and motivated Consultant Physician to join our dynamic team in Coimbatore. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises:\nDr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Conduct routine health assessments and screenings\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Master's degree preferred\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in Wound Care\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n• Proficiency in Pharmacovigilance\n• Proficiency in CPT Codes\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises!",
